{
  "name": "Momentum Confluence \u2014 VIX Calm Regime Gate (BTC/ETH/SOL)",
  "rationale": "Thesis: on the three highest-liquidity majors, short (5d) and medium (15d) momentum agreement persists best when broad-market fear (VIX) is calm; spikes in VIX precede crypto risk-off. Disconfirmer: the VIX ceiling must matter \u2014 if confluence during high-VIX (turbulent) periods is equally profitable, the calm gate is a no-op and this is plain majors momentum.",
  "catalyst": "Dual-horizon momentum aligns while VIX sits below a fitted calm ceiling.",
